      "version": "1.1",
      "releaseNotes": "- New \"More Games\" feature: Browse our other Apple Watch games directly from the start screen\n- Redesigned start screen: Cleaner layout with game title, start button, and quick-access icons\n- Controls info moved to dedicated view — tap the icon to see all gestures\n- More screen space during gameplay — removed the on-screen gesture overlay\n",
      "seenAt": "2026-04-07T22:56:14Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Level 2: Dino Rider\n- Ride a Triceratops mount into battle against ghost clone enemies\n- Your Level 1 gameplay creates the enemies you face in Level 2\n- 3 raptor allies fight alongside you\n- 3 boss dinosaur encounters: Stegosaurus, Ankylosaurus, and Brachiosaurus\n- Smash through breakable walls as you charge forward\n- Tap to push during epic dino clash boss fights\n\nNew Features\n- Level select menu with progression system\n- Cross-promotion: discover our other games from the start screen\n- Redesigned start screen with cleaner layout\n- Health heart pickups and slow HP regeneration\n",
      "seenAt": "2026-04-10T22:45:46Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.3",
      "releaseNotes": "Level 3: Dino Stampede\n- Drive a truck through a dusk-lit city while dinosaurs stampede through the streets\n- Steer with the Digital Crown to dodge stampeding Raptors, Stegosaurus, and Triceratops\n- Swipe to dodge charging Brachiosaurus long-necks\n- Tap to push through when stuck on a dino\n- T-Rex boss chase at 700m — tap rapidly to escape its jaws\n- Destructible city buildings with animated debris\n- Floating embers, glowing street lights, and lit windows for atmospheric dusk setting\n- Your blocky soldier rides inside the truck cabin\n\nLevel 2 Updates\n- Enhanced Triceratops and Raptor models with detailed eyes, teeth, and tails\n- Improved boss lock-up mechanics and movement fixes\n\n",
      "seenAt": "2026-04-16T16:19:30Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.4",
      "releaseNotes": "Version 1.4 – BIG UPDATE\n\n 3 New Levels Added (4, 5, 6)\n\n* Level 4: Roller Coaster Ride\n    * High-speed action with dynamic camera\n    * Collect boosts and race through intense tracks\n   \n Level 5: Cowboy\n    * Auto-forward movement with full directional control\n    * 8-direction shooting system\n    * Compact HUD optimized for Apple Watch gameplay\n Level 6: Open World Mode\n    * Explore freely with no boundaries\n    * New camera system for immersive navigation\n    * Standalone experience — play your way\n\n Improvements & Fixes\n\n* Fixed restart issue after victory in Level 5\n* Performance and stability improvements\n* Camera tuning for better Apple Watch gameplay",
